{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Bound cleanup after durable control flow is selected.** This waits for `invokeHandler()` to return before observing the already-selected manager outcome. A blocking handler `finally` can therefore prevent a valid `PENDING`/`RETRYING` response until Lambda times out. Add a deadline-aware fallback using `lambdaContext.getRemainingTimeInMillis()` that reserves time for shutdown and response delivery, and test a selected outcome with blocked cleanup and little remaining time.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774Rgs","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":127,"observation_digest":"bad2f11a5220f139357ac2d1f7f5a45d1d280bc50a3bc9d9977fa3548d2de610","observation_id":"aro_v1_xljpcgssedytsnl2yli7p5nelu","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dfsghg7x42wurlqw3jtatlfyq7","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"e28732585b856fb3f3117acf4b2d8b5162423d7c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":127,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_adgc3ti34p25ubc6jrecrgri4f","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
